{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":124,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["A Song of degrees of David. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 124:1"},"If ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it had not been"]}," the LORD who was on our side, now may Israel say; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 124:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 124:2"},"If ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it had not been"]}," the LORD who was on our side, when men rose up against us: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 124:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 124:3"},"Then they had swallowed us up quick, when their wrath was kindled against us: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 124:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 124:4"},"Then the waters had overwhelmed us, the stream had gone over our soul: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 124:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 124:5"},"Then the proud waters had gone over our soul. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 124:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 124:6"},"Blessed ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["be"]}," the LORD, who hath not given us ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as"]}," a prey to their teeth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 124:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 124:7"},"Our soul is escaped as a bird out of the snare of the fowlers: the snare is broken, and we are escaped. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 124:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 124:8"},"Our help ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," in the name of the LORD, who made heaven and earth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 124:8"}]}]}
